  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_StorageSpaces_CreateSpace_ResiliencyDesc_ThreeWayMirror:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka tuhi he whakaata āhua-toru i ngā tārua e toru o ō raraunga, e āwhina ana ki te tiaki i a koe mai i ngā rahunga kōpae e rua. E hiahia ana i ngā kōpae ōkiko e rima i te iti rawa i te puna.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_StorageSpaces_CreateSpace_ResiliencyDesc_Simple:
