Ka taea te huri i ō whakaaro mō te takoha topenga reo ina pai koe.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Speech_BlockSpeechLogging:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kātia te tuku atu i ōku topenga reo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Speech_AllowSpeechServices\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te weto i a koe te āhukahuka reo tuihono, tē āhei koe te whakamahi taupānga e whakamahi i tā Microsoft hangarau āhukahuka reo tuihono.  Heoi anō, whakamahia tonutia te taupānga Āhukahuka Kōrero Windows me ērā atu ratonga reo kāore e whakamahi i tā Microsoft hangarau āhukahuka reo.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Speech_AllowSpeechLogging:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tīmata ki te tuku ōku topenga reo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Speech_AllowSpeechCommands_LearnMore\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako me pēhea te whakamahi i te kōrero ki HoloLens
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Speech_AllowSpeechCommands_ExplanationText\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakamahia tō reo ki te kōrero ki a HoloLens. Ka whakarongo tonu tō HoloLens mō tō reo tāuru ina kā te pūrere, otirā ka taea ō tono ā-waha te whakamahi hei whakahaere i tō pūrere.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Speech_AllowSpeechCommands\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaweto koe i te āhukahuka kōrero, e kore e taea te whakamahi tō reo mō te āhukareo, mō te tauwhiti rānei ki Cortana me ētahi atu taupānga, ā, kāore e urupare tō HoloLens ki ngā tono ā-waha.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Send_Required_Diagnostic_Data\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Raraunga tātari hiahiatia
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Send_Optional_Diagnostic_Data\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Raraunga tātari kōwhiria
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Sending_Required_Diagnostic_Data\Title:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: E tuku ana koe i ngā raraunga tātaritanga e hiahiatia ana
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Sending_Required_Diagnostic_Data\Subtitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Hei wāhanga o te whakamahi Windows, ka tuku tō pūrere ki a Microsoft i tētahi huinga raraunga whāiti e hiahiatia ana kia haumaru ai tō pūrere me tō pūnaha mahi, kia hōu rawa, me te mahi ki tāu e tūmanako ana.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Sending_Optional_Diagnostic_Data\Title:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tukua ngā raraunga tātaritanga kōwhiri
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Sending_Optional_Diagnostic_Data\Subtitle:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Āwhinatia a Microsoft kia whakapai ake i tō wheako Windows me te whakatika tere ake i ngā raruraru mā te tuku mai i ētahi atu raraunga tātaritanga. Kei roto i tēnei ngā raraunga mō ngā paetukutuku ka tirohia e koe, he pēhea tō whakamahi i ngā taupānga me ngā āhuahira, me te tuku pūrongo hapa whakarei.

Ka ōrite te haumaru o tō pūrere, ā, ka mahi pūnoa ahakoa kāore koe e tuku raraunga tātaritanga kōwhiri.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Required_Diagnostic_Data_Description\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka kohikohia e Microsoft te raraunga tātari e hāngai ana ki tō pūrere, ōna tautuhinga, āheinga hoki, mēnā raini ia e mahi tika hoki ana.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_PrivacyLink\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Hītori Ngohe i roto i te Tauākī Tūmataitinga
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_PersonalizeInkType_Toggle\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakamahia aku tauira hītori patopato me te tuhinga hei waihanga i tētahi papakupu ritenga
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_PersonalizeInkType_Hololens_Toggle\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakamahia aku tauira hītori patopato me te tuhinga hei waihanga i tētahi papakupu ritenga
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_PersonalizeInkType_Description\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tiki huatau pai ake mā te waihanga i tētahi papakupu ritenga ki ō mōhiohio pato me te tuhi ā-ringa. Ki te mono koe i tēnei tautuhinga, ka ūkuia tō papakupu, ā, kāore ō huatau e whakawhaiarotia.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Personalization_ViewDictionary\DisplayName:
