  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Personalization_Personalization_On_GenericError:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kua puta he raruraru. Ngana anō ā muri ake.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Personalization_Personalization_On_Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaweto i ngā ratonga reo me ngā huatau pato.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Personalization_Personalization_On_ConfirmationFlyoutButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakawetohia
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Personalization_Personalization_On_Confirmation:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ina whakawetohia e koe tēnei, e kore anō koe e āhei te kōrero ki a Cortana, ā, ka mukua katoatia atu i te papakupu ngā mea katoa ka whakamahia e Windows hei whakapiki i ngā huatau mō te waituhitanga me te pato.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Personalization_Personalization_On_ActionDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ina whakawetohia tēnei, e kore koe e āhei ki te korero ki a Cortana, ā, ka whakawāteatia atu hoki tō papakupu patopato, waituhitanga hoki. Ko ngā ratonga kāore e whirinaki ana ki te kapua, penei i te Āhukahuka Kōrero Windows ka haere tonu. Ka haere tonu hoki ngā huatau pato me te āhukahuka tuhinga mā te papakupu pūnaha.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Personalization_Personalization_Off_GenericError:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kua puta he raruraru. Ngana anō ā muri ake.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Personalization_Personalization_Off_Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaweto i ngā ratonga reo me ngā huatau pato.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Personalization_Personalization_Off_ConfirmationFlyoutButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakakā
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Personalization_Personalization_Off_Confirmation:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka whakamahia ngā mōhiohio pēnei i ngā tauira kōrero me te tuhi ā-ringa, me te hītori patopatoto kia mōhio pai ake ki a koe, me te whakapai ake anō i ngā hua me ngā ratonga a Microsoft.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Personalization_Personalization_Off_ActionDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ina whakawetohia tēnei, e kore koe e āhei ki te korero ki a Cortana, ā, ka whakawāteatia atu hoki tō papakupu patopato, waituhitanga hoki. Ko ngā ratonga kāore e whirinaki ana ki te kapua, penei i te Āhukahuka Kōrero Windows ka haere tonu. Ka haere tonu hoki ngā huatau pato me te āhukahuka tuhinga mā te papakupu pūnaha.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Personalization_DataUsageExplanationText\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakamahi i tō reo ki te mahi i ētahi mea i ngā taupānga Cortana, Store hoki, me te whakamahi i ō hītori pato, tauira tuhinga hoki hei hanga i tētahi papakupu kaiwhakamahi paetata e pae ake ai ngā huatau māu. Ka whakamahia e Microsoft tō tāurunga ā-reo hei whakapai noa ake i te haere o ngā ratonga reo ā-kapua.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Personalization_DataUsageExplanationTextHololens\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakamahia te āhukahuka reo kia mahi i ētahi mea pēnei i te āhukareo papapātuhi, te kōrero hoki ki ngā taupānga Cortana, Store hoki, me te whakamahi i ō hītori pato hei hanga i tētahi papakupu kaiwhakamahi paetata e pae ake ai ngā huatau māu. Mā Microsoft e whakamahi tō tāurunga reo hei whakapiki kē ake i te mahi o ngā ratonga reo kapua.

Ina kā HoloLens, ka whakarongo mātou ki te tāurunga reo, ā, ka tukua hoki ō kōrero katoa ki te ratonga āhuka kōrero ā-kapua o Microsoft.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Optional_Diagnostic_Data_Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tukuna ngā raraunga tātari mō ngā pae tukutuku e tirohia ana e koe, me tāu nei whakamahi i ngā taupānga me ngā āhuahira, me ētahi atu mōhiohio mō te hauora pūrere, te hohenga pūrere, me ērā atu pūrongo hapa. 

Ka ōrite te haumarutanga o tō pūrere, me tāna whakamahinga ki te kōwhiria raini e koe rawa e hiahiatia te tuari raraunga tātari kōwhiria.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Motion_AdditionalInfoText\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me uru ētahi taupānga ki ō raraunga nekenga kia mahi ki tērā e hiahiatia ana. Ki te whakawetoa he taupānga i konei ka whakaitia pea ngā mea e taea ana e koe.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_LocationShowOnTimeline\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka taea te whakaatu e tō rainawā te wāhi i mahi ai koe i ētahi ngohe.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_LocationHistoryClear_Completed:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: I mukua te hītori tauwāhi
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_LocationHistoryClear2\DisplayName:
