    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tiki i ētahi atu mōhiohio mō ēnei tautuhinga
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Privacy_Header\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiria pēhea nei te rahi o te raraunga tātarie hiahiatia ana e koe te tukuna ki a Microsoft, me ētahi atu tautuhinga e hāngai ana ki te raraunga tātari, pēhea hoki nei te rite tonutanga o tā mātou uia urupare. He mea whakahaumarutia, whakahōungia a Windows, raparongoātia ngā raruraru, whakawhanaketia hoki ngā hua te raraunga tātari.
