  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Phone_ManagePhones_AdditionalText\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te wetehono koe i tēnei RW, e kore e āhei kia whiwhi taumahi, tuhinga rānei i tukua mai i tō waea.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Phone_ManagePhones_AdditionalTextV2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te wetehono koe i tēnei Rorohiko, kāore koe e kite e whiwhi rānei i te kuputuhi, ngā whakaahua, ngā whakamōhiotanga, me ngā whārangitukutuku mai i tō waea ki tēnei pūrere. Ka kore e taea e koe te kite i ngā mata o tō waea Android ki tō Rorohiko.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Phone_ManagePhones\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Wetehono i tēnei RW
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Phone_CrossDevice_AdditionalText\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Hei hono i tō waea, whakakāngia Wheako Tiri.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Phone_CrossDevice\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Haere ki ngā tautuhinga Wheako Tiri.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Phone_AddPhone_V2_OptedIn\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tiki ngā mea katoa e aroha ana e koe mō tō waea i tō RW – whakautu inaianei ki te karere, tiri whakaahua, ngā whakamōhiotanga me ētahi atu mea. Ka taea hoki e kore te tiri hononga whārangi tukutuku mai i tō waea tōtika ki tō Rorohiko.

Tīkina ētahi atu taupānga i tō waea kia pai ake ai tāna mahi ki tō Rorohiko.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Phone_AddPhone_V2_NotOptedIn\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tiki ngā mea katoa e aroha ana e koe mō tō waea i tō RW – whakautu inaianei ki te karere, tiri whakaahua, ngā whakamōhiotanga me ētahi atu mea. Ka taea hoki e koe te tiri hononga whārangi tukutuku mai i tō waea tōtika ki tō Rorohiko.

Tāpiritia tō waea Android, iPhone i raro nei hei tīmata.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Phone_AddPhone_OptedIn\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tīmata te tirotiro mā te ipurangi, te tuhi īmēra me te whakamahi taupānga i tō waea, ka haere inamata tonu i tō RW i muri.

Kei te nunuitanga atu o ngā taupānga ka honoa e koe, ko te mahanga atu o ngā wheako pūrere ka hikaia e koe.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Phone_AddPhone_NotOptedIn\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tīmata te tirotiro mā te ipurangi, te tuhi īmēra me te whakamahi taupānga i tō waea, ka haere inamata tonu i tō RW i muri.

Hei tīmata, tāpiritia tētahi waea i raro iho. Mā mātou te tuku hononga ki te taupānga tuatahi mā te karere kuputuhi, e āhei ai koe ki te tuku whārangi tukutuku hāngai atu i tō waea ki tō RW.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Phone_AddPhone_NeedsMsa\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tīmata te tirotiro mā te ipurangi, te tuhi īmēra me te whakamahi taupānga i tō waea, ka haere inamata tonu i tō RW i muri.

Takiuru mai, ka tāpiri ai i tētahi waea i raro iho. Mā mātou te tuku hononga ki te taupānga tuatahi mā te karere kuputuhi, e āhei ai koe ki te tuku whārangi tukutuku hāngai atu i tō waea ki tō RW.
