  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_HoloLens_Utilities_Calibration_Help\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tiki āwhina mō te tōkarikari whatu
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_HoloLens_Utilities_Calibration\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakahaere tōkarikari whatu
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_HoloLens_Utilities_CalibrationDescription\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaritea te HoloLens mō ō karu. Mā konei e pai ake te mārama o tō kite atatoru, e whakamārie tō tiro i ēnā, e pono anō te pāhekoheko. Mō ngā huanga pai, whakahaeretia te tōkarikari whatu ina whakamahi tētahi tangata hōu i te pūrere.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_Uninstall\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Wetetāuta Windows Mixed Reality
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_UninstallWarning\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: I mua i te wetetāuta, āta titiro kua momotu koe i tō maupane i tō RW, me te kati i te Tomokanga Ao Rangirua.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_UninstallDescription\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Mēnā kāore te Windows Mixed Reality i te haere tika, ki te hiahia rānei koe ki te whakawātea i ētahi mokowā puku, ka taea e koe te wetetāuta. Mā tēnei hoki e tango ētahi mōhiohio whai pānga, engari ka noho tonu ngā taupānga tāuta-tōmua Windows Mixed Reality i tō rorohiko. Hei tango i tētahi taupānga i riro i a koe i te Pātaka, pāwhiri matau ki te tahua Tīmata, ka tīpako ai i Wetetāuta. 

Hei tīmata anō i te whakamahi i te Windows Mixed Reality, haere ki Tīmata > Tomokanga Ao Rangirua.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_UninstallDescription2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Mēnā kāore te Windows Mixed Reality i te mahi tika, ki te hiahia whakawātea rānei i te mokowā kōpae, wetetāutatia ka tāuta anō ai (haere ki Tīmata ka tīpako i te Tomokanga Ao Rangirua). Ka tangohia ō mōhiohio kaiwhakamahi ina wetetāutatia, engari ka noho tonu ō taupānga ao rangirua ki tō rorohiko.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Holographic_ClearDataDescription\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka hopu tō pūrere i tō taiao kia tino pai ai tō wheako.

Ki te ūkui koe i tēnei raraunga, ka ngaro pea ētahi ihirangi taupānga i tō taiao, ā, kāore koe e kite i te rohenga nāu i tatū. Hei waihanga anō i te rohenga, i tō rorohiko haere ki Tīmata > Tomokanga AO Rangirua> Whakahaere tātunga.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_HDR_Battery_InfoText\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiri i tētahi o ngā pouaka taki i raro nei hei whakapiki i te oranga pūhiko:
