  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Flights_Dialogs_OptInConfirmBody\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kei te āwhina te hunga pēnei i a koe i Windows mā ngā piriona tāngata huri noa i te ao. Mā te waitohu mō tēnei papatono, kei te whakaae koe kia kohi a Microsoft i ētahi mōhiohio mai i tō RW mō ō wheako i roto i Windows. Ki te tāuta koe i ētahi pūmanawa momo-tōmua ki tō RW, tērā pea ka nui atu ngā ngārara me ētahi raruraru i ō ngā putanga kua āta whakaputaina ki te ao. 
