  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_DeliveryOptimization_Explanation\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Mēnā kāore i te tōtika tō hononga Ipurangi, kei te whakahōu rānei i ngā pūrere maha, mā te whakaae ki ngā tīkinga ake i ētahi atu RW e whakahohoro i te tukanga. 

Ki te whakakā koe i tēnei, ka tukua atu pea e tō RW ētahi wāhanga o ngā whakahōutanga Windows me ngā taupānga ki ētahi atu RW i tō whatunga paetata, ki te Ipurangi rānei. E kore tō RW e tukuatu i ngā kai ki ētahi atu RW i te ipurangi i a koe e noho ana i tētahi whatunga ine.
