  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae taupānga kia whakahaere reo irirangi pūrere
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaae koe ki te urunga, ka taea e koe te kōwhiri ko ēhea ngā taupānga ka āhei kia whakahaere i ō reo irirangi pūrere whakamōhiotanga mā te whakamahi i ngā tautuhinga i tēnei whārangi. Mā te whakakāhore i te urunga e kati te whakahaere a ngā taupānga ō ngā reo irirangi pūrere.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_UserGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tukuna ngā taupānga kia whakahaere irirangi pūrere
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_UserGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiri ko ēhea ngā taupānga ka taea ō reo irirangi pūrere
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae urunga kia whakahaere irirangi i tēnei pūrere
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaae koe ki te urunga, ka āhei te hunga whakamahi i tēnei pūrere kia kōwhiri mehemea ka whai urunga ō rātou taupānga ki ngā reo irirangi pūrere mā te whakamahi i ngā tautuhinga i tēnei whārangi. Mā te whakakāhore i te urunga e kati te whakahaere a ngā taupānga i ngā reo irirangi pūrere.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_SystemGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Urunga mana reo irirangi
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_SystemGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka taea e ngā tangata katoa e whakamahi ana i tēnei pūrere te kōwhiri mēnā ka whai urunga ō rātou taupānga ki te whakahaere irirangi pūrere ina whakakāhia i tēnei
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiri ko ēhea ngā taupānga ka taea ō reo irirangi pūrere
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka whakamahi irirangi ētahi taupānga—pēnei i te Bluetooth—i roto i tō pūrere ki te tuku me te whiwhi raraunga. I ētahi wā, me whakakā, me whakaweto e ngā taupānga ēnei irirangi kia mahi pērā i manakohia.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Pictures_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tukuna ngā taupānga kia uru ki tō puna pikitia?
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Pictures_UserGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiri ko ēhea ngā taupānga ka taea te uru ki tō puna pikitia
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Pictures_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Urunga puna pikitia
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Pictures_SystemGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka taea e ngā tāngata katoa e whakamahi ana i tēnei pūrere te kōwhiri mēnā ka whai urunga ō rātou taupānga ki tō rātou puna pikitia ina kā tēnei
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaaetia ngā taupānga te waea mai, waea atu raini
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaaetia ngā waeatanga e koe, e oti i a koe te kōwhiria ko ēhea ngā taupānga e oti te waea mai, waea atu raini mā te whakamahi i ngā tautuhinga ki te whārangi nei. Ka whakamahia e Windows te waea kua tūhonotia e koe ki tēnei rorohiko mā ēnei waeatanga. Mā te whakahore urunga ka rāhuitia te waea mai, waea atu raini a ngā taupānga.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_UserGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tukuna ngā taupānga kia mahi waea
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_UserGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiria ko ēhea taupānga ka taea te mahi waea
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_UsageHistory_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tirohia ko ēhea taupānga kua tonoa kia waea atu i te 7 rā kua hipa 
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae waea atu i tēnei pūrere
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ina whakaaetia e koe ngā waeatanga, e oti i a ngā tāngata e whakamahi ana i te pūrere nei te kōwhiria mēnā raini e oti i a ā rātou taupānga te waea mai, waea atu raini mā te whakamahi i ngā tautuhinga ki te whārangi nei. Ina Kā ai te kōwhiringa, ka whakamahia e Windows te ratonga kawe o te waea kua tūhonotia ki te rorohiko nei kia waea mai, waea atu raini (he utunga anō pea ka pā mai i tō kaiwhakarato ratonga). Mā te whakahore urunga ka rāhuitia te waea mai, waea atu raini a ngā taupānga.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_SystemGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Urunga waea
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_SystemGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka taea e ngā tāngata katoa e whakamahi ana i tēnei pūrere te kōwhiri mēnā ka taea e ō rātou taupānga te waea ina whakakāhia i tēnei
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiria ko ēhea ngā taupānga e oti waea mai, waea atu raini
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me waea mai, waea atu, waea mai raini ētahi taupānga kia tika ai te mahi. Ka whakamahia e Windows te waea kua tūhonotia e koe ki tēnei rorohiko mā ēnei waeatanga. Mā te weto i tētahi taupānga ki konei ka whakatepea pea tāna e taea ai.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCallHistory_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaaetia ngā taupānga kia uru ki tō hītori waea
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCallHistory_UserGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiria ko ēhea ngā taupānga kia uru ki tō hītori waea
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCallHistory_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Urunga hītori waea
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCallHistory_SystemGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka taea e ngā tāngata katoa e whakamahi ana i tēnei pūrere te kōwhiri mēnā ka uru ō rātou taupānga ki tō rātou hītori waea ina kā tēnei
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Notifications_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tukuna ngā taupānga kia uru ki ō whakamōhiotanga
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Notifications_UserGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiria ko ēhea ngā taupānga kia uru ki ō whakamōhiotanga
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Notifications_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Urunga whakamōhiotanga
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Notifications_SystemGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka taea e ngā tāngata katoa e whakamahi ana i tēnei pūrere te kōwhiri mēnā ka uru ō rātou taupānga ki ō rātou whakamōhiotanga ina kā tēnei
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_MusicLibrary_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaaetia ngā taupānga kia uru ki tō puna puoro
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_MusicLibrary_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaae urunga koe, ka taea te kōwhiri i ngā taupānga hei uru ki tō puna puoro mā ngā tautuhinga i tēnei whārangi. Ki te whakakāhore urunga koe, ka āraia ngā taupānga katoa e wātea ana i te Microsoft Store i Windows 11 i te urunga ki tō puna puoro.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_MusicLibrary_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaaetia te urunga ki ngā puna puoro i tēnei pūrere
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_MusicLibrary_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaae urunga koe, ka āhei te hunga whakamahi i tēnei pūrere ki te kōwhiri kia whai urunga ā rātou taupānga ki ō rātou puna puoro mā ngā tautuhinga i tēnei whārangi. Ki te whakakāhore urunga koe, ka āraia ngā taupānga katoa e wātea ana i te Microsoft Store i Windows 11 i te urunga ki te puna puoro o tētahi atu.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_MusicLibrary_PrivacyLearnMore\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako anō mō ngā tautuhinga tūmataitinga puoro
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_MusicLibrary_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiria ko ēhea ngā taupānga kia uru ki tō puna puoro
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_MusicLibrary_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me whai urunga ētahi taupānga ki tō puna puoro kia mahi tika ai. Ka whakawetohia he taupānga i konei ka whakawhāititia pea āna mahi.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Motion_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae taupānga kia uru ki ō raraunga nekenga
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Motion_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaae koe ki te urunga, ka taea e koe te kōwhiri ko ēhea ngā taupānga ka āhei kia uru ki tō raraunga nekenga mā te whakamahi i ngā tautuhinga i tēnei whārangi. Mā te ārai i te urunga e aukati anake i ngā taupānga kia kaua ai e uru ki ō raraunga nekenga, e kohi rānei i ō hītori nekenga. E kore Windows e āraia.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Motion_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae i te urunga ki te raraunga nekenga i tēnei pūrere
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Motion_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaae koe ki te urunga, ka āhei te hunga whakamahi i tēnei pūrere kia kōwhiri mehemea ka whai urunga ō rātou taupānga ki ō rātou raraunga nekenga mā te whakamahi i ngā tautuhinga i tēnei whārangi. Mā te whakakāhore i te urunga e katia ai te uru o tētahi taupānga ki ngā raraunga nekenga, te kohi rānei i te hītori nekenga o tētahi tangata ahakoa ko wai.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Motion_PrivacyLearnMore\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako i ētahi atu mea mō ngā tautuhinga tūmataitinga raraunga nekenga
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Motion_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiri i ngā taupānga ka āhei ki te uru ki ō raraunga nekenga
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Motion_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: E hiahia ana ētahi taupānga kia uru ki ō raraunga nekenga kia pai ai te haere. Mā te whakaweto i tētahi taupānga ki konei e herea ai pea te whānui o ngā mahi ka taea e ia.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_WindowsAndServicesGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tukua ngā Ratonga Windows me te Taupānga kia uru ki tō hopuoro
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_WindowsAndServicesGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Anei te rārangi o ngā Ratonga Windows me te Taupānga kua uru ki tō hopuoro i mua
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae taupānga kia uru ki tō hopureo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaae koe ki te urunga, ka taea e koe te kōwhiri ko ēhea ngā taupānga ka whai urunga ki tō hopureo mā te whakamahi i ngā tautuhinga i tēnei whārangi. Mā te whakakāhore urunga ka aukati i te urunga a ngā taupānga ki tō hopureo.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_UserGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tukuna ngā taupānga kia uru ki tō hopuoro
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_UserGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiria ko ēhea ngā taupānga ka whai urunga ki tō hopuoro
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_UsageHistory_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tirohia ko ēhea taupānga kua uru ki tō hopuoro i te 7 rā kua hipa 
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae i te urunga ki te hopureo i tēnei pūrere
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaae koe ki te urunga, ka āhei te hunga whakamahi i tēnei pūrere kia kōwhiri mehemea ka whai urunga ō rātou taupānga ki ō rātou uruoro mā te whakamahi i ngā tautuhinga i tēnei whārangi. Mā te whakakāhore urunga ka āraia ngā āhuahira Windows, ngā taupānga Microsoft Store, me te nuinga o ngā taupānga papamahi kia kore e uru ki tō uruoro. 
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_SystemGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Urunga uruoro
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_SystemGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka taea e ngā tāngata katoa e whakamahi ana i tēnei pūrere te kōwhiri mēnā he urunga hopuoro ō rātou taupānga ina kā tēnei
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_Spotlight_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kei a Windows he whakamahinga uruoro tē tūmanakohia hei arotakenga māu
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_PrivacyLearnMore\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako anō mō ngā tautuhinga tūmataitinga uruoro
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_MicInfo\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakamahi he taupānga i tō uruoro, ka kitea tēnei ata i te paetaumahi.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_MainHeading\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakamahi he taupānga i tō uruoro, ka kitea tētahi ata uruoro i te paetaumahi Windows.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_ClassicAppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae taupānga kāmera kia uru ki tō uruoro
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_ClassicAppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me whai urunga etahi taupānga me ētahi āhuahira Windows ki tō hopuoro kia mahi tika. Mā te whakaweto i tēnei tautuhinga i konei ka whakatikia pea ngā mahi a ngā taupānga papamahi me Windows. 
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_ClassicAppList_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tukuna ngā taupānga papamahi kia uru ki tō hopuoro
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_ClassicAppList_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
