  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiria ko ēhea ngā taupānga kia uru ki tō hopureo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me whai urunga ētahi taupānga ki tō uruoro kia mahi tika ai. Ki te whakawetoa he taupānga i konei ka whakaitia pea ngā mea e taea e taua taupānga.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaaetia ngā taupānga kia pānui pātuhinga.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaae koe ki te urunga, ka taea e koe te kōwhiri ngā taupānga ka taea te pānui karere mā te pātuhi mā te whakamahi i ngā tautuhinga i te whārangi nei. Mā te whakahore urunga ka aukatia te pānui pātuhi e ngā taupānga.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_UserGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tukuna ngā taupānga kia pānui karere
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_UserGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiria ngā taupānga e āhei te pānui karere
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_UsageHistory_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tirohia ko ēhea taupānga kua uru ki ō karere kuputuhi i te 7 rā kua hipa 
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae i te urunga ki ngā karere uputuhi i tēnei pūrere
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaaetia urunga e koe, e oti i a ngā tāngata e whakamahi ana i tēnei pūrere mēnā raini kei ā rātou taupānga te āheinga kia pānuitia pātuhinga mā te whakamahi i te tautuhinga ki te whārangi nei. Mā te whakahore urunga ka rāhuitia te pānui pātuhi a ngā taupānga.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_SystemGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Urunga kareretanga
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_SystemGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka āhei te kaiwhakamahi i tēnei pūrere te kōwhiri mēnā kia uru āna taupānga ki te pānui karere mā te tūhononga pūkoro ina kā ana
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiria ko ēhea ngā taupānga e oti te pānui pātuhinga
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me pānui pātuhinga e ētahi taupānga kia tika ai te mahi. Ki te whakawetohia tētahi taupānga ki konei, ka mimiti pea tāna e oti ai te mahi.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_WindowsAndServicesGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tukua ngā Ratonga Windows me te Taupānga kia uru ki tō tauwāhi
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_WindowsAndServicesGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Anei te rārangi o ngā Ratonga Windows me te Taupānga kua uru ki tō tauwāhi i mua
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaaetia ngā taupānga kia uru ki tō tauwāhi
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaae koe ki te urunga, ka taea e koe te whakamahi i ngā tautuhinga i tēnei whārangi ki te kōwhiri ko ēhea ngā taupānga ka āhei kia uru ki te tauwāhi pū me te hītori tauwāhi o tō pūrere ki te whakahohe i ngā wheako ā-tauwāhi pēnei i ngā tohutohu huarahi me te tohu huarere. Mēnā kua takiuru koe mā tētahi pūkete Microsoft ki tēnei pūrere, ka tiakina tō tauwāhi whakamutunga e mōhiotia ana ki te kapua, ā, ka tiria ki ētahi atu pūrere ina takiuru koe mā tō pūkete Microsoft.  Mā te aukati urunga ka āraia anake ngā taupānga kua rārangitia i tēnei whārangi i te urunga ki tō tauwāhi.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_UserGlobal2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tukuna ngā taupānga kia uru ki tō tauwāhi
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_UserGlobal2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka taea e ngā taupānga katoa te uru ki te tauwāhi tata, engari ka taea e koe te kōwhiri ko ēhea ngā taupānga ka uru ki tō tauwāhi pū
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_UsageHistory_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tirohia ko ēhea taupānga kua uru ki tō tauwāhi i te 7 rā kua hipa 
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaaetia te urunga ki te tauwahi i tēnei pūrere
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaae koe ki te urunga, ka whakahohe koe i Windows kia whakamahi i te kaha o tō pūrere hei whakatau i tō tauwāhi, ā, mā Microsoft e whakamahi ō raraunga tauwāhi hei whakapiki i te ratonga tauwāhi.  Ka taea e te hunga whakamahi i tēnei pūrere te kōwhiri mehemea ka uru ā rātou taupānga ki te tauwāhi mā te whakamahi i ngā tautuhinga i tēnei whārangi. Mā te aukati urunga ka āraia Windows kia kaua ai e whakarato i te tauwāhi ki ngā āhuahira Windows, ki ngā taupānga Microsoft Store, me te nuinga o ngā taupānga papamahi.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_TurnOffButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakawetohia
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_Link\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako atu anō
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_Dialog_Title:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Mono ratonga tauwāhi
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_Dialog_Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Mā tēnei e mono ai te tauwāhi mō ngā tāngata katoa e whakamahi ana i tēnei pūrere. Ka wāteakore a Kimihia taku pūrere me te rohe wā aunoa. Kua kore e āhei ngā taupānga te tono tauwāhi, te kimi Wi-Fi pātata, Bluetooth rānei.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_CancelButtonText:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakakore
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_AdditionalDescription_On:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka wātea te tauwāhi ki a Windows, ā, ka taea e tētahi ā wai rā e whakamahi ana i tēnei pūrere te kōwhiri ahakoa te uru a ngā taupānga ki tōna tauwāhi
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_AdditionalDescription_Off:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kua weto te tauwāhi, ā, ka kore āhei a Windows me ērā atu kaiwhakamahi kei tēnei pūrere te whakamahi tauwāhi.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ngā ratonga tauwāhi
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaaetia te mana kaiwhakamahi
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakakāngia, whakawetohia rānei te tauwāhi mō ngā kaiwhakamahi katoa i te pūrere me ngā ratonga pūnaha
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_Spotlight_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kei a Windows he whakamahinga tauwāhi tē tūmanakohia hei arotakenga māu
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_MainHeading\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka taea e Windows te whakamahi ngā āheinga o tō pūrere hei whakatau i tō tauwāhi. Ka whakamahia pea e Microsoft ngā raraunga tauwāhi hei whakapiki i te tika o ana ratonga tauwāhi.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_ClassicAppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tuku kia uru ngā taupānga papamahi ki tō tauwāhi pū
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_ClassicAppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me uru ētahi taupānga me ngā āhuahira Windows ki tō tauwāhi kia mahi tika ai. Mā te whakaweto i tēnei tautuhinga i konei ka whāititia pea tā ngā taupānga papamahi me tā Windows e taea ai.
