  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Gaze_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae taupānga kia uru ki tō pūaroturuki whatu
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Gaze_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaae koe ki te urunga, ka taea e koe te kōwhiri ko ēhea ngā taupānga ka āhei kia uru ki tō pūaroturuki whatu mā te whakamahi i ngā tautuhinga i tēnei whārangi. Mā te whakakāhore i te urunga e kati noa iho te uru o ētahi taupānga ki tō pūaroturuki whatu. E kore Windows e āraia.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Gaze_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaae i te urunga ki te pūaroturuki whatu i tēnei pūrere
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Gaze_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaae koe ki te urunga, ka āhei te hunga whakamahi i tēnei pūrere kia kōwhiri mehemea ka whai urunga ki te pūaroturuki whatu mā te whakamahi i ngā tautuhinga i tēnei whārangi. Mā te whakakāhore i te urunga e kati te uru o Windows me ngā taupānga ki tō pūaroturuki whatu, hāunga ngā taupānga e uru ana ki te pūaroturuki whatu mā te whakamahi ratonga rerekē i tērā i tāpaetia mai e Windows.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Gaze_SystemGlobal\DisplayName:
