  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BackgroundSpatialPerception_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaaetia te urunga papamuri ki ō nekehanga
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BackgroundSpatialPerception_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaae koe ki te urunga, ka taea e koe te kōwhiri mehemea ka whai urunga ō taupānga ki te nekehanga o tō māhunga, ringa, ngā pūmana nekenga, me ētahi atu ahanoa aroturuki, ina whakahaere ā-papamuri ngā taupānga mā te whakamahi i ngā tautuhinga i tēnei whārangi. Mā te aukati urunga ka āraia ngā taupānga mai i te urunga atu ki ō nekehanga ina whakahaere ngā taupānga i te papamuri.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BackgroundSpatialPerception_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaaetia te urunga papamuri ki ngā nekehanga kaiwhakamahi
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BackgroundSpatialPerception_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ki te whakaae koe ki te urunga, ka taea e ngā tāngata e whakamahi ana i tēnei pūrere ki te kōwhiri mēnā ka whai urunga ō rātou taupānga ki te nekehanga o te māhunga, o ngā ringa, o ngā pūmana nekenga me ētahi atu ahanoa aroturuki o te kaiwhakamahi, ina whakahaere ā-papamuri ngā taupānga mā te whakamahi i ngā tautuhinga i tēnei whārangi. Mā te aukati urunga ka āraia ngā taupānga mai i te urunga atu ki ngā neketanga a tētahi tangata ahakoa ina whakahaere ngā taupānga i te papamuri.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BackgroundSpatialPerception_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiri ko ēhea ngā taupānga ka āhei kia uru ki ō nekehanga ina haere i te papamuri
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_BackgroundSpatialPerception_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: E hiahia ana ētahi taupānga ki te uru ki ō nekehanga ina haere i te papamuri ki te mahi tika. Ki te whakawetoa he taupānga i konei ka whakaitia pea āna mahi.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_AppSilo_EmptyListDescription:
