  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_AppRequestedDownloads_MainHeading\Description:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka taea e Windows te tikiake aunoa i ngā kōnae mai i tō kaiwhakarato rokiroki tuihono mō ngā taupānga e tono ai. Ki te ārai koe i ētahi o aua taupānga kia kaua e tono i ngā tikiake kōnae aunoa, ka taea e koe te tuku tono anō ki konei.
