  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_App_Cellular_Access_Description\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Mā te whakaweto i te whakamahinga raraunga pūkoro mō tētahi taupānga motuhake e whakaheke pea tō whakamahi raraunga. Ina whakawetohia, e kore e taea e te taupānga te whakamahi pūkoro hei tuku, hei whiwhi rānei i te raraunga pūkoro, engari ka taea ētahi atu hononga whatunga. Kāore pea ētahi o ngā taupānga kua tāutatia mai i te tukutuku e rārangitia kei raro nei.
