  \SystemSettings\Resources\Holographic_Visuals_PerformanceOptimization_Description\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: He pānga ngā kōwhiringa wheako ki te tāhuahua taupānga, te āpure tirohanga, me ētahi āhuahira wātea i roto i te A Rangirua Windows.

Mā te kōwhiri i te arotau mō te mahinga ka whakarite i tētahi wheako hōu ake, inarā i ngā rorohiko me ngā whakairoiro kōmitimiti. Mā te kōwhiri i te kounga ataata pai rawa ka pā pea ki te mahi a tēnei rorohiko.

Ka tīmata anō pea te Windows Mixed Reality mēnā ka hurihia tēnei tautuhinga.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\Holographic_StartupAndDesktop_AlternateHomeExperience_LearnMoreLink\Content:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako atu anō
  \SystemSettings\Resources\Holographic_StartupAndDesktop_AlternateHomeExperience_Info\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore e wātea tēnei kōwhiringa ki te kore i tāuta, i whirihora hoki te Windows Mixed Reality mō SteamVR.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\Holographic_StartupAndDesktop_AlternateHomeExperience_Info2\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore e wātea tēnei kōwhiringa ki te kore i tāutatia, i whirihoratia hoki te Windows Mixed Reality mō SteamVR.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\Holographic_StartupAndDesktop_AlternateHomeExperience\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tīmata aunoatia te Windows Mixed Reality mō SteamVR ina whakarewaina te Mixed Reality Portal.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\Holographic_StartupAndDesktop_AlternateHomeExperience2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ina whakatuwhera ahau i te Tomokanga Ao Rangirua, tīmata aunoatia te Windows Mixed Reality mō te SteamVR
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_SleepTimeout_Timeout\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ina kua pāeko tō maupane Ao Kē Windows, ka moe tō maupane ā muri i te:
