    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: *Ina āraia te maupane i te moe ā muri i ngā meneti 30, neke atu raini, o te mahi-kore, ka tahuna-ā-roto pea te mata.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_SleepTimeout_TimeoutWarning2\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Mā te kōwhiri i tētahi wāhiki moe o te 30 meneti, neke atu rānei ka pā pea te tahu-mai ki te whakaaturanga o tō maupane.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_SleepTimeout_IdleAppSuspension\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Me whakatārewa te Windows Mixed Reality me ōna taupānga ina moe taku maupane. Ka pā pea te huringa o tēnei tautuhinga i te mahinga o tēnei RW.
