  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_VirtualDisplay_Group_Warning\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Mā te ūkui i tēnei tautuhinga ka whakatio ai pea tō whakaaturanga maupane mō tētahi wā poto ina whakarewa i ngā taupānga e whirinaki ana ki ngā whakaaturanga mariko.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_VirtualDisplay_Group_Description\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kei reira ētahi momo taupānga (tae atu ki te pūtirotiro tukutuku) e hiahia ana ki ngā whakaaturanga mariko kia taea ai e koe te whakamahi i roto i tō kāinga ao rangirua. Mā te tīpako i tēnei tautuhinga ka pā pea ki te tahora o ō whakaatu ā-tinana, engari mēnā kei te whakamahi koe i ētahi atu whakaaturanga ōkiko.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_VirtualDisplay_Group\DisplayName:
