  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_PresenceSensorBehavior_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Te whakawhiti tāurunga
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_PresenceSensorBehavior_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kōwhiri me pēhea e whakawhiti ai te tāuru i waenga i te Papamahi Rorohiko me te ao rangirua:
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_DesktopView_Group_Description\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: I a koe e mau ana i tētahi maupane, ka kitea e Windows ina neke te arotahi ki ngā taupānga i tō papamahi. Mēnā kua tīpakohia tēnei tautuhinga, ka tīmata aunoatia e Windows te taupānga Papamahi i roto i ao rangirua mōu.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_DesktopView_Group_DescriptionLabel\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ina e mau ana koe tētahi maupane, ka taea a Windows te kite ka nuku te arotahi ki ngā taupānga kei tōu papamahi me te tīmata aunoa i te taupānga Papamahi tiro mōu.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_DesktopView_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tiro papamahi
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_DesktopViewAutoLaunch\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakatuwheratia te taupānga Papamahi tiro ina e pahawa ana he taupānga papamahi te arotahi, mau e au hoki taku maupane.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_DesktopViewAutoLaunch2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakatuwheratia te taupānga Papamahi tiro ina e pahawa ana he taupānga papamahi te arotahi, mau e au hoki taku maupane.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_ClassicApps_VirtualMonitorPreallocation\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Waihanga ngā whakaaturanga mariko mō ngā taupānga tauhira ina ka whakaoho i te ao rangirua.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_ClassicApps_VirtualMonitorPreallocationWarning\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakaweto waihanga whakaaturanga mariko kei te whakaoho mā te mono ka hua pea i tō whakaaturanga maupane poto kia pātiotio ina whakarewa koe i tētahi taupānga tauhira roto i ao rangirua.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_ClassicApps_VirtualMonitorPreallocation2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Waihanga whakaaturanga mariko mō ngā taupānga tauhira ina ka whakaoho i te ao rangirua.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_ClassicApps_Group_Description\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kei roto i te Windows Mixed Reality te tautoko māori mō ngā taupānga papamahi tauhira. Kia pēnei ai, ka whakamahi a Windows i ngā whakaaturanga mariko hei whakaatu i ēnei taupānga i te kāinga ao rangirua. Heoi anō, ka pā pea ēnei whakaatu mariko ki tō tahora whakaaturanga, inarā he maha ō whakaaturanga ōkiko. 

Mā te mono i te waihanga whakaatu mariko i te whakaohonga ka whakatio rangitahi pea tō whakaaturanga maupane ina whakarewa koe i tētahi taupānga tauhira i roto i te ao rangirua.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_ClassicApps_Group_DescriptionLabel\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kei roto a Windows Mixed Reality ngā tautoko taketake mō ngā taupānga papamahi tauhira. Hei whakamahi, ka whakamahia e Windows ngā whakaaturanga mariko hei whakaatu ēnei taupānga i te kāinga ao rangirua. Heoi anō, ēnei whakaatu mariko ka pā pea ki tōu tahora whakaatu, inā kei a koe ngā whakaatu ōkiko maha.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_ClassicApps_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Taupānga tauhira
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_AutomaticStartup_Group_DescriptionLabel\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Mā Windows e taea te tīmataria aunoatia ngā Tomokanga ao Rangirua ina ka mono-mai, te whakapiri ki tō maupane rānei. Ka tīmata ngā wā katoa Tomokanga ao Rangirua kia whakatuwheratia ai tētahi taupānga i hoahoatia mō te ao rangirua.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_AutomaticStartup_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tīmata aunoa
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicStartupAndDesktop_AutomaticStartup_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka taea e Windows te tīmata aunoa i te Tomokanga Ao Rangirua ina mono mai, ina puru rānei koe ki tō maupane
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_Speech_UseSpeechCommands\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakamahia te āhukahuka kōrero i Windows Mixed Reality tae atu ki te āhukareo me te tauwhiti ki ngā taupānga e whakamahi ana i ngā tono reo. Āhukahuka kōrero ka whakarongo ina haere te ao rangirua.

Mēnā kei te kā tō kawerongo whakamōhio kōrero tuihono, kua whakahohea hoki ki ētahi atu wheako, pēnei i a Cortana, Āhukareo Windows rānei, ka tukua hoki ō kōrero katoa e mātou ki te ratonga āhuka kōrero ā-kapua o Microsoft. Ka whakamahi mātou i ō raraunga reo hei āwhina ki te whakapai ake i ā mātou ratonga kōrero. Ki te kore koe e hiahia ō kōrero katoa ki te tuku ki a Microsoft hei te wā e kā ana tō kawerongo, whakaweto i te tautuhinga āhukahuka Kōrero i tēnei whārangi i mua i te āhukahuka kōrero tuihono mā te whakahohe.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_Speech_SpeechCommandsDisabled\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kāore i te wātea i roto i te reo e tīpakona ana ināianei
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_Speech_MixedRealityLink\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako me pēhea te whakamahi i te kōrero i roto i te ao rangirua
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_Speech_LearnMoreLink\Content:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ako me pēhea te whakamahi i te kōrero i roto i te ao rangirua
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_Speech_ChangeOnlineSpeechSetting\Content:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Hurihia te tautuhinga āhukahuka kōrero tuihono
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_Speech\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Āhukahuka kōrero
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_SpeechSettingsLink\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Hurihia te tautuhinga āhukahuka kōrero tuihono
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_SpeechRecognition_Description\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ka whakarongo āhukahuka kōrero i ngā wā katoa ki tō āhukareo me ngā tauwhitinga ki ngā taupānga mā te tono reo.

Mēnā kei roto te āhukahuka kōrero tuihono i ētahi atu wheako Windows, pēnei i Cortana, i te Āhukareo Windows rānei, ka tukuna ngā mea katoa e kī ana koe ki te ratonga āhukahuka kōrero ā-kapua o Microsoft. Ki te kore koe e hiahia kia tukuna ngā mea katoa ki a Microsoft ina whakamahi koe i tō maupane, whakawetohia te tautuhinga āhukahuka kōrero i tēnei whārangi i mua i te whakakā i te āhukahuka kōrero tuihono i ētahi atu taupānga, āhuahira Microsoft rānei.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_SpeechRecognition\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Whakamahia te āhukahuka kōrero i roto i te Windows Mixed Reality.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_Speech2\DisplayName:
