    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ina haere a Tomokanga Ao Rangirua, whakawhiti ki te ororongo maupane
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_Audio_HMDMicText\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Ina haere a Tomokanga Ao Rangirua, whakawhiti ki te hopureo maupane
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicSpeechAndAudio_Audio_DescriptionLabel\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Windows Mixed Reality tino pai rawa me ngā tukuoro rō-tonu me te hopureo o tō maupane, me rānei kawerongo, he uruoro i te tūhono ki te tauranga ororongo.  Kāore e tautokona ana ngā pūrere ororongo Bluetooth.
