  \SystemSettings\Resources\CorpDeviceManagementWorkplaceJoinDescription\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Tīpakona tēnei kōwhiringa ki te whakamahi koe i Office 365, i ētahi atu ratonga pakihi rānei i Microsoft. Whāia te hononga i raro nei kia haere ki tō whārangi pūkete, ka tīpako anō ai i Tāpiri pūkete mahi, kura rāne, me te hoatu i ō mōhiohio. (Ki te kore e wātea taua kōwhiringa, kua takiuru kē koe.)
  \SystemSettings\Resources\CorpDeviceManagementWorkplaceDiagnostics\Content:
