  \SystemSettings\Resources\CorpDeviceManagementUsersAreDifferentText\Text:
    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: Kei te pūnaha tētahi atu kaiwhakamahi kua tūhono kē ki tētahi mahi, kura rānei. Tangohia taua tūhononga mahi, kura rānei, ka ngana anō.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\CorpDeviceManagementUpgradeMessage\Text:
