    Candidate Language=MI-NZ: I muri i tō tūhono atu, ka kohia pea e tō mahi, kura rānei ngā mōhiotanga mōu. Ka tāuta, ka tango rānei i ētahi taupānga, te huri tautuhinga, monokia āhuahira rānei, te muku ihirangi, te tautuhi anō i tō rorohiko rānei. He rerekē te whakarite a ia mahi, kura rānei i ēnei mea, nō reira me kōrero koe ki tō kaitautoko kia mōhio ake ai koe.
